   164	    mixing rule (warn/raise under non-allow policies).
   165	
   166	    The explicit opt-in requires ONE consistent note for the whole pool:
   167	    either `pooling_note` (a single decision covering all sources), or
   168	    `source_notes` (the per-source opt-in notes recorded when each source
   169	    was loaded) — the latter must be non-empty for every source and all
   170	    identical, and must agree with `pooling_note` when both are given
